{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "root",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "# C｜控制与对齐｜L2\n\n目标：把人的意图与多重约束稳定转成 AI 可执行控制，并保持非目标变量不漂移。\n\n状态：PARTIAL → OPEN\n来源：AI问题解决总图_L1"
    },
    {
      "id": "intent",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 620,
      "y": -360,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "# C-INTENT｜674-119\n\n隐性创作意图 → 机器可表示 / 可执行 / 可验证\n\n状态：THEORY DONE → EXPERIMENT\n冻结：IRG / Relation / Priority / Rationale / Trace\n下一步：历史 A/B、否决、修改记录离线验证"
    },
    {
      "id": "constraint",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 620,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "# C-CONSTRAINT｜674-120\n\n多约束解耦、冲突与优先级\n\n状态：CYCLE-01 DONE\n冻结：Constraint Satisfaction + Preservation Cost\nPriority / Strength / LOCK-FLEX 分离\n下一步：20–30 个历史修改样本"
    },
    {
      "id": "preserve",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 620,
      "y": 380,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "# C-PRESERVE｜非目标保持\n\n问题：改 A 时，B/C/身份/画风/结构能否严格保持？\n\n状态：OPEN\n与 C-CONSTRAINT 强耦合"
    },
    {
      "id": "known",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -620,
      "y": -330,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "# KNOWN / SOLUTION\n\nConditioning\nReference Guidance\nDisentanglement\nPreference Alignment\nConstraint Control\n局部编辑 / 多条件控制"
    },
    {
      "id": "boundary",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -620,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "# BOUNDARY / GAP\n\n条件干扰\n变量串扰\n冲突与优先级\n多轮漂移\n显式条件 ≠ 完整创作意图\n\nGAP：U1 + U2 + U4"
    },
    {
      "id": "paper",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "AI问题解决Canvas/论文问题系统_L1.canvas",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 520,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "social_c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1250,
      "y": -180,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 360,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "# SOCIAL-C｜社会解决状态\n\n社会成熟度（面向我们的用途）：约 6/10\n\n8｜显式条件 / 基础规则约束\n7｜多条件控制\n6｜局部编辑 / 非目标保持\n5｜多轮不漂移\n4｜隐性创作意图→机器约束\n\n原则：成熟能力直接吸收；真正研究保留在隐性意图 + 长期保持。"
    },
    {
      "id": "social_c_absorb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1250,
      "y": -620,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "# ABSORB｜7–10\n\n显式条件控制｜reference / conditioning\n基础 guardrail / policy constraint\n常规局部编辑机制\n\n动作：实现，不再作为原创研究题。"
    },
    {
      "id": "social_c_adapt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1780,
      "y": -120,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "# ADAPT｜4–6\n\nconstraint satisfaction\ndisentanglement\npreservation cost\n多条件 priority / strength\n多轮一致性方法\n\n动作：吸收后嫁接 119/120。"
    },
    {
      "id": "social_c_research",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1250,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "# RESEARCH｜1–3/开放缺口\n\n真正保留：\n1. 隐性创作意图如何机器化\n2. 改 A 时 B/C/身份/画风长期不漂\n\n证据：ICCV 2025 Multi-turn Consistent Image Editing 仍以多轮一致性与误差累积为核心难题。"
    }
  ],
